    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> casts the module's automated Dimension Door.</p><div><p><em>Wondrous Item, Rare</em></p></div><p>This cape smells faintly of brimstone. While wearing it, you can use it to cast <em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDimensionD]{Dimension Door}</em> as a Magic action. This property can't be used again until the next dawn.</p><p>When you teleport with that spell, you leave behind a cloud of smoke. The space you left is &amp;Reference[LightlyObscured] by that smoke until the end of your next turn.</p>",
